"hero": "\n<section\n        class=\"page-hero service-hero\"\n        style=\"--service-image: url(&quot;plumbing-leak-perth.png&quot;)\"\n      >\n        <div class=\"shell\">\n          {{ppp:breadcrumbs}}\n          <span class=\"eyebrow\">Plumbing repair service</span>\n          <h1>Tap &amp; Mixer Repairs Perth</h1>\n<p>Book tap and mixer repairs in Perth for dripping taps, leaking fittings, stiff controls and unreliable water delivery. Ellis Services Group assesses the existing fitting and connections, explains repair or replacement options and confirms the work in a written quote. Our local plumbers service kitchen, bathroom and laundry fixtures.</p>\n          <a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html\">Book tap and mixer repair</a>\n        </div>\n      </section>" as TrustedHtml,
"sections": [
