"html": "\n<section class=\"section service-quote\" id=\"service-quote\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Tap repair and mixer replacement costs in Perth</h2><div class=\"price-guide\" aria-labelledby=\"ellis-price-guide\">\n            <div class=\"shell\">\n              <div class=\"price-guide__intro\">\n                <p class=\"price-guide__kicker\">Ellis Price Guide</p>\n                <h2 id=\"ellis-price-guide\">Taps and mixers price guide</h2>\n                <p>\n                  A practical guide for a standard tap or mixer repair at a\n                  Perth property.\n                </p>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"price-guide__grid\">\n                <article class=\"price-guide__item\">\n                  <h3>Taps & mixers</h3>\n                  <p class=\"price-guide__range\">AUD $165–$420</p>\n                  <p class=\"price-guide__unit\">per repair · incl. GST</p>\n                </article>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"price-guide__notice\">\n                <strong>Guide conditions:</strong> These AUD ranges are for\n                standard-hours, standard-scope work and are incl. GST. Access,\n                materials, extra pipe, cable or circuit work, compliance work,\n                emergency or after-hours work and unforeseen repairs are\n                confirmed in a written quote before work proceeds.\n              </p>\n            </div>\n          </div><h3>What your written quote covers</h3><p>The fitting type, condition, accessible connections and availability of compatible parts affect whether repair or replacement is practical. A surface fitting may be straightforward to access, while concealed connections require a different scope. We confirm the fitting, connection work and any access work in the quote.</p><p>The final written quote sets out the work included, materials and any agreed additional tasks. We explain changes to the scope before extra work proceeds. <a href=\"contact.html?service=tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html\">Request a tap and mixer repair quote</a>.</p></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"id": "service-faq",
"kind": "faq",
"container": "\n<section class=\"section faq service-editorial-faq\" id=\"service-faq\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Tap &amp; Mixer Repairs Perth FAQs</h2><!-- site-intent:start --><div class=\"intent-content\" data-site-intent><h3>A dripping tap, a base leak and a low-flow outlet</h3><p>Describe where water appears: the outlet, handle, tap base or the connections below the fixture. A flow change at one tap is different from low pressure across the property. The fitting condition and compatible parts determine whether repair or replacement is appropriate.</p><ul class=\"intent-links\"><li><a href=\"water-leak-detection-perth.html\">Leaks with an unclear source</a></li><li><a href=\"fixtures-appliances-perth.html\">New fixture and connection work</a></li><li><a href=\"dishwasher-installation-perth.html\">Dishwasher Installation &amp; Connections Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"shower-plumbing-repairs-perth.html\">Shower Plumbing Leak Repairs Perth</a></li><li><a href=\"water-pressure-perth.html\">Low Water Pressure &amp; Water Hammer Perth</a></li></ul><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:0:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:0:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:1:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:1:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:2:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:2:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:3:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:3:answer}}</details><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:4:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:4:answer}}</details></div><!-- site-intent:end --><details><summary>{{ppp:faq:5:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:5:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:6:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:6:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:7:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:7:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:8:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:8:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:9:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:9:answer}}</details>\n<details><summary>{{ppp:faq:10:question}}</summary>{{ppp:faq:10:answer}}</details></div></section>" as TrustedHtml,
"items": [
{
"question": "Does a dripping mixer always need replacing?",
"answer": "<p>No. The cause, fitting condition and availability of compatible parts need assessment. Ask the quote to distinguish a repair from product supply and installation if replacement is recommended.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can I supply the replacement mixer myself?",
"answer": "<p>Discuss the product and existing connections first. Dimensions, mounting and compatibility can affect installation. The quote should identify who supplies the fitting and whether additional connection work is required.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Why does a tap keep dripping after it is turned off?",
"answer": "<p>A worn seal or fitting fault can let water pass after shut-off; an outlet drip and base leak need different checks. <a href=\"#learn-about-tap-mixer-repairs-perth\">Read the explanation.</a></p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can a dripping tap waste water over time?",
"answer": "<p>Yes. Continued dripping wastes water; the amount depends on the actual rate and how long it continues. <a href=\"#learn-about-tap-mixer-repairs-perth\">Read the explanation.</a></p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can I supply my own replacement mixer tap?",
"answer": "<p>Yes, if the selected mixer suits the installation. Confirm compatibility and the installation inclusions before buying. <a href=\"#learn-about-tap-mixer-repairs-perth\">Read the explanation.</a></p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Do I need to diagnose the problem first?",
"answer": "<p>No. Describe the observable change and property context. We inspect the affected area on site to establish the cause and confirm the repair scope. If more access is needed, we agree it with you first.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can I send photos?",
"answer": "<p>Photos are optional: email safely taken photos to maxinemaintenance.au@outlook.com. You can contact us without photos. Do not approach a hazard, remove covers or dismantle equipment to take a photo.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can you help with a dripping tap?",
"answer": "<p>Yes. Tell us the fixture location, whether it drips constantly and any other changes you have noticed.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Should I try to dismantle a mixer?",
"answer": "<p>No. It is safer to describe the problem and leave the fitting intact for assessment.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Do you work on rental-property fixtures?",
"answer": "<p>Yes. Property managers can include work-order and access details.</p>" as TrustedHtml
},
{
"question": "Can you install a tap I have already purchased?",
"answer": "<p>We assess the product specifications, mounting arrangement and connection compatibility before agreeing the installation. Tell us whether product supply or installation only is required so the written quote covers the right scope.</p>" as TrustedHtml
}
]
},
{
"id": "service-booking",
"kind": "rich",
"html": "\n<section class=\"section contact-band service-booking\" id=\"service-booking\"><div class=\"shell service-reading\"><h2>Book tap and mixer repair in Perth</h2><p>Include the suburb, fixture location, tap type if known and whether you want a repair or a replacement. For a customer-supplied fitting, add product details and tell us whether the connection is concealed. Our local team covers <a href=\"service-areas.html\">all six Perth service regions</a> from our office at 140 St Georges Terrace, Perth WA 6000.</p><p>Call to discuss the work or send the property details through our enquiry form. You do not need to diagnose the fault or complete a technical inspection before contacting us.</p><a class=\"button\" href=\"tel:0413477667\">Call 0413 477 667</a> <a class=\"button service-book-button\" href=\"contact.html?service=tap-mixer-repairs-perth.html\">Request a visit &amp; written quote</a></div></section>" as TrustedHtml
},
